CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function public.prov_record(regclass,text,text,text,jsonb,jsonb,text) line 7 at RAISE
SELECT prov_entity('samples', '7'), prov_entity('results', 'r1', 'density');
   prov_entity    |        prov_entity        
------------------+---------------------------
 public.samples:7 | public.results:r1#density
(1 row)

